flowchart LR
  accTitle: System architecture — output-stationary matrix multiplication
  accDescr: Host write ports load two input_skew_buffer instances while not busy. Each buffer combines matrix storage with combinational lane skew. A moves right and B down through the array. The controller clears, computes, and captures all accumulators into the output buffer, which serves the host read port.

  subgraph top["systolic_top — specified integration (issue #4)"]
    gate["Host A/B write ports<br/>a_we, a_addr, a_wdata<br/>b_we, b_addr, b_wdata<br/>we_A = a_we AND !busy<br/>we_B = b_we AND !busy"]
    subgraph abuf["input_skew_buffer (A), COLUMN_LANES = 0"]
      amem["A storage<br/>N × N signed DATA_W<br/>row-major writes"]
      askew["Combinational row skew<br/>en and 0 ≤ step − i < K:<br/>lane i = A[i][step − i]<br/>else zero"]
      amem --> askew
    end
    subgraph bbuf["input_skew_buffer (B), COLUMN_LANES = 1"]
      bmem["B storage<br/>N × N signed DATA_W<br/>row-major writes"]
      bskew["Combinational column skew<br/>en and 0 ≤ step − j < K:<br/>lane j = B[step − j][j]<br/>else zero"]
      bmem --> bskew
    end
    arr["systolic_array<br/>N × N pe<br/>A → right; B → down<br/>C[i][j] stays in each PE"]
    obuf["output_buffer<br/>N × N ACC_W<br/>capture / hold C<br/>Host read port: c_addr in<br/>signed c_rdata out (ACC_W)<br/>combinational read"]
    ctrl["sa_controller<br/>Host: start in<br/>busy, done, cycle_count out<br/>CLEAR → COMPUTE → CAPTURE"]
    gate --> amem
    gate --> bmem
    askew -->|"a_left: N × DATA_W"| arr
    bskew -->|"b_top: N × DATA_W"| arr
    arr -->|"acc_flat: N × N × ACC_W"| obuf
    ctrl -. "en, step" .-> askew
    ctrl -. "en, step" .-> bskew
    ctrl -. "clear, en" .-> arr
    ctrl -. "capture" .-> obuf
    ctrl -. "busy" .-> gate
  end
  classDef control fill:#fff3d6,stroke:#8b6016,color:#13263d
  class ctrl control
